  "details": "The idea is pretty simple: A menu to allow toggling different blend shapes or potentially mesh renderers. This would be handy so that you could just load all holiday related attachments onto a single avatar without having to upload a new version each time. \n\nAny blend shape that has the prefix of \"vrcvar.\" would show up in the menu with a slider. I figure something similar could be used for a toggle button for meshes with a specific prefix.",
